date-released: 2026-09-23
abstract: >-
  Open institutional map of the Chilean State for public affairs, public policy,
  regulatory analysis and stakeholder mapping. The dataset separates stable
  institutions from volatile officeholders and documents provenance, coverage
  and uncertainty across central, regional and local public institutions.
keywords:
  - Chile
  - public affairs
  - public policy
  - stakeholder mapping
  - government
  - regulation
  - institutional analysis
  - open data
